{"id":"495beb1615196027","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-zfc-pcf2-closed-system.md","title":"ZFC Pcf2 Closed System","display":"df-zfc-pcf2-closed-system — ZFC Pcf2 Closed System","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-pcf2-closed-system","aliases":["58-df-zfc-pcf2-closed-system"],"display":"df-zfc-pcf2-closed-system — ZFC Pcf2 Closed System","depends_on":["[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-pcf2-smooth-system.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-pcf.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-pcf2-closed-system"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-pcf2-closed-system</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-pcf2-closed-system — ZFC Pcf2 Closed System"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b3592c20d8a8ef2e\" href=\"?note=b3592c20d8a8ef2e\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-zfc-pcf2-smooth-system.md\">../batch04/58-df-zfc-pcf2-smooth-system.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b82cea6742372d50\" href=\"?note=b82cea6742372d50\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-pcf.md\">../batch06/58-df-pcf.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,\\mathcal B\\in V\">\\(A,\\mathcal B\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2SmoothSystem}_S(A,\\operatorname{pcf}(A),\\mathcal B)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2SmoothSystem}_S(A,\\operatorname{pcf}(A),\\mathcal B)\\)</span> (smooth-system predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pcf}\">\\(\\operatorname{pcf}\\)</span> is the possible-cofinalities operation</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2ClosedSystem}_S(A,\\mathcal B)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2ClosedSystem}_S(A,\\mathcal B)\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf2\\text{-}closed\\text{-}system} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcPcf2ClosedSystem}_S(A,\\mathcal B)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcPcf2SmoothSystem}_S(A,\\operatorname{pcf}(A),\\mathcal B)\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in\\operatorname{pcf}(A)\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{pcf}(\\mathcal B(\\lambda))\\cap A=\\mathcal B(\\lambda)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf2\\text{-}closed\\text{-}system} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcPcf2ClosedSystem}_S(A,\\mathcal B)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcPcf2SmoothSystem}_S(A,\\operatorname{pcf}(A),\\mathcal B)\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in\\operatorname{pcf}(A)\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{pcf}(\\mathcal B(\\lambda))\\cap A=\\mathcal B(\\lambda)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The smooth-system predicate receives its required spectrum parameter <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pcf}(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{pcf}(A)\\)</span>. Closedness is relative to the ambient progressive set: each generator contains exactly those members of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> lying in its own PCF spectrum.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch04/58-df-zfc-pcf2-smooth-system.md","status":"resolved","id":"b3592c20d8a8ef2e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-pcf2-smooth-system.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-pcf.md","status":"resolved","id":"b82cea6742372d50","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-pcf.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,\\mathcal B\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2SmoothSystem}_S(A,\\operatorname{pcf}(A),\\mathcal B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pcf}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2ClosedSystem}_S(A,\\mathcal B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf2\\text{-}closed\\text{-}system} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcPcf2ClosedSystem}_S(A,\\mathcal B)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcPcf2SmoothSystem}_S(A,\\operatorname{pcf}(A),\\mathcal B)\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in\\operatorname{pcf}(A)\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{pcf}(\\mathcal B(\\lambda))\\cap A=\\mathcal B(\\lambda)\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pcf}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false}],"bytes":1218,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3039","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-pcf2-closed-system.md|58-df-zfc-pcf2-closed-system]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["b3592c20d8a8ef2e","b82cea6742372d50"]}